<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">OKOLO - ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Okoloshiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwupu Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa Enzu Umba OKOLOSI</para>
  <para style="toc2">Colossians</para>
  <para style="toc3">Col</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kwupu Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa Enzu Umba</para>
  <para style="mt1">OKOLOSI</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwupu ungwu Ɔpɔlu a ka laa enzu umba Okolosi ɔ ka laa ɔshɔshi uwu kwuse ungwu Okolosi, mu ɛzhi iyi Eshiya Iyɛri mu ononoyo uwu Ɛfisu. Akwu Ɔpɔlu gba a bɔ ɔshɔshi ele le mo, tetete e yi mu kizɛ ingyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu a bɔ eyi mangyi akwɛyi a gagyi enzu umba ɛduma mu Ɛfisu, kwuse ungwɔkwu ungwu ɛzhi iyi Roma mu Eshiya akwɛyi a lɔ mba ma. Ɔpɔlu a pwa tee wa zɔ ɛzu iyangba o yi mu ɔshɔshi uwu Okolosi. Enzu mbɔlɛ ɔ zɔ tee gba onzu a gyite le yitu iyi Ukpo kaa la fya isama shɛ, mɛga e gbo ɔya la &lt;&lt;asu mbala wa to keyi umba kwundu&gt;&gt; umbafo. Enzu mbɔlɛ o kyo ɔ zɔ tee mɛga onzu awu a nyama kaa la mbwalu ɛrama iyi ɛsɔ izɛma mbala kiya ingyirimo mbala apula iyifo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔpɔlu a ka kwupu kwɔlɛ kaa la ra la ɛzɔ e ngbulolo iyi wa mbwalu kaa le to wo ɛzɔ iyangba ɛlɛ ma. Opwu uwu a gba akwu tee Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e do te e shi isama ngyɔɔ; tee ɛrama mbala iwomo iyifo ɛlɛ lala i shi onzu e ngbo ɔgwuzɛ ma. Mu Okrasi gba Ukpo e wo kwudu kwɔlɛ le, mawu gba a gba ngwu a ka la ɛnwu le. Ikyomesu mbala Okrasi kɛɛkyi gba kwudu kwɔlɛ kwu yi eyifulomo iyi isama le. Akwɛyi Ɔpɔlu e so apula iyi bɔkɔ ɛzɔ iyɛku ɛlɛ ii wo mu luzɛ undu wambwalu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ishoshi tee lo yitu tee Otakikusu uwu bɔkɔ e to kwupu ungwu Ɔpɔlu kwɔlɛ a ka ngwa mu Okolosi awu, Onesimu uwu bɔkɔ akwu unye uwu bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu a ka kwupwu mu reshi wu a ka la Ɔfilimɔ awu gba e fye wu mo le.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Mɛmi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu Iyemo(1.1- 8)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛduma iyi Okrasi (1.9-2.19)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kwunyɔ ungwepo mu Okrasi (2.20-4.6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Imbwama iyi iso(4.7-18)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Kwupu kwɔlɛ kwu ngyi mbaa mi Ɔpɔlu, uwu bɔkɔ mu inyama iyi Ukpo, mi kwu u zɛ ilɔ uwu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala umanyi nzu Otimoti.<verse eid="COL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Mi ka laa enzu umba Ukpo mu kwusɛ ungwu Okolosi, umba bɔkɔ akwu ɛmanyi nzu umba bɔkɔ ɔ bɔ shɛ mu luzɛ kyaa mbala Okrasi awu:</para>
  <para style="m" vid="COL 1:2">Ukpo Ete nzu le shi yi esheshi mbala egbo inɔma.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛnyi Igbɛlɛma Mbala Ukpo Ilɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Ki gbɛlɛ Ukpo, Ete wu Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, ɛnyi iyɔkpɔɔ kwuyengwu ki lɛ yi Ukpo. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Moo ki pwa ɛza iyi ikwidufulo yi mu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala idɛnyi iyi lu yi yi laa enzu umba Ukpo lɛɛbi. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ilɔ engbulolo ɛlɛ, Ɛza Iyesheshi ɛlɛ, i bo munyi yi kwuyengwu kwonze, lu pwa tee ii shi eyifulomo. Ikwidufulo yi mbala idɛnyi yi ɛlɛ i ri mu apula iyi lu yi mu eyifulomo yi iyi bɔkɔ o she yi yi moshi awu. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Eza iyesheshi ɛlɛ i yi mu ifulama munamuna mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, i shi enzu o yi mu luzɛ izɛma undu bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi kyamate bɔkɔ i wo mekeka yi awu, lunyi enzu umba Okolosi ngbaa ɔnuwu kwonze bɔkɔ lu pwa ɛza iyesheshi iyi Ukpo ɛlɛ nzhii ba kwuye ngwɔlɛ akwɛyi lu bu yitu yi tee akwu ongbulolo. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Lu pwa ɛza iyesheshi iyi Ukpo ɛlɛ mafyi iyi umanyinzu uwu idɛnyi nzu, Epafarasi, uwu akwu u wo ɛduma iyi Okrasi shɛ meka yi mu kwunzu nzu awu. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Uwu gba a ba nzu ɛza iyi idɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu e shi yi le.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ ki lɛ yi Ukpo iyɔkpɔɔ ngbaa kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ki pwa ɛza iyayi awu. Ki lɛ Ukpo tee le shi yi iyitu gyɔɔ iyi kiya ingyi a gyi, mbala ilukwu mbala iyitu iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu ee shi. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Akwɛyi luu zɛ luzɛ undu Ɔkwu a gyi, akwɛyi luu wo iyi bɔkɔ ii she wu iyɔkpɔɔ. Lu wa laa imuma iyesheshi kyamate ɛwɛyi tayi, akwɛyi lu bulɔma mu iyitu iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Ki lɛ Ukpo tee le shi kaa la lu kɔma mu ɛkpasu iyi ii ngyi mu ekpasu iyi inzumbɛku wu, kaa la lu yidu mbala kiya ingyinangyina ingyi ki du yi, akwɛyi <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />lu gbɛlɛ Ada ɛnyi iyɔkpɔɔ laa ɔnyɛ, moo uwu gba e shi ki domo tee la ki yi ogbo mu ogu uwu bɔkɔ o shi la wambwalu kwuyengwu ɛsu irimo iyi ɛbɛ awu. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Moo a wa nzu ma mu ɛkpasu iyi ipwu akwɛyi e bo nzu mbaa ɛsu irimo iyi Umɛ wu, uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi wu, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />uwu bɔkɔ munyi wu gba oo sa nzu ma le, gba o gba la ingbomo nzu o kpa nzu le.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okrasi Mbala Ɛduma Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Okrasi gba akwu uwɔ uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ eyi i mawu mo awu. Uwu gba akwu Umɛ ɔnzɔnu uwu kwonze uwu a ka apula iyi o wo lɛɛbi ma le. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Moo i zɛ mawu gba Ukpo e wo kiya ingyinangyina moshi mbala mu kwudu kwɔlɛ le, apula iyi bɔkɔ o ma yi mbala iyi bɔkɔ o ma yi mo, i kyo mbala ɛndu iyi ekpasu mbala alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo mbala asu mbala apula iyi i yi ekpasu mbala idomo; Ukpo e wo yi lɛɛbi mbala wu, kwuwo wu. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Okrasi e yi dɛ ishi kiya ingyinangyina ki bi yi le, uwu gba a ra la apula lɛɛbi mu riyi yi le. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Uwu gba akwu reshi ingyi ɛnwu wu, ɔshɔshi le; uwu gba akwu undu uwu kwunyɔ ungwu ɛnwu le. Uwu gba akwu Umɛ ɔnzɔnu uwu kwonze uwu bɔkɔ o yi wu mo mu kwuvɔ le kaa uwu gba lakwu uwu kwonze mu apula lɛɛbi le. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Moo i she la Ukpo tee iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ i yi mawu, li yi mu Umɛ wu, Ɔzhizɔsi tete. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />I zɛ mu Umɛ ele gba Ukpo a gba la kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi e lomesu mbala ɛnwu le. Ukpo e bo la iŋɔma iyoloto mu ɛnzhi umba Umɛ mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu akwɛyi a gba laa apula lɛɛbi, iyi i yi mɛzhi mbala iyi i yi moshi e lomesu mbala ɛnwu.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Mekyi, lu ndama mbala Ukpo akwɛyi lu kwu agewa wu kwuwongu apula iyira iyi lu wo mbala iyi lu bi egbo yi. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Kekelele ba Ukpo e wo yi lu kwu ɛmɛza wu ŋa kwuwongu lukwu undu Umɛ wu, kaa la lu yi kɛrikɛri, sɛsɛ mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi ingbomo midu wu mo. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Lunyi ba la lu so wu mu luzɛ undu ikwu idu lu fulo, la lu rima ngiri, la lu lafya laa eyi ifulomo iyi lu fya kwuyengwu lu pwa iso iyeshi ɛlɛ awu mo. Akwu kwuwongu iso iyeshi ɛlɛ gba, Imi, Ɔpɔlu, mi kwu umɛgba le - iso iyeshi iyi bɔkɔ ɔ tanu yi laa uwewe mu kwudu kwɔlɛ awu.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛduma Iyi Ɔpɔlu Mu Ɔshɔshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Kekelele mi yi mu ɔnyɛ imuma kwuwongu inyashi iyi mi yi mu imama kwuwo yi, kwuwongu mu inyashi imama mi ɛlɛ, mi yi mu imbwama kaa la mi nyɔlɔ iyi bɔkɔ i shimo mu inyashi iyi Okrasi a ma kwuwongu ɛnwu wu, ɔshɔshi. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Ukpo gba e shi mi kwu umɛgba uwu ɔshɔshi le. E shi mi ɛduma ɛlɛ tee la mi wo kwuwo yi. Inyi gba akwu ɛduma iyi anu itama iyi iso wu lɛɛbi le, <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />iyi bɔkɔ e nvye yi mo laa enzu ngbaa mekyi, kekelele ba a wa yi a zɔ enzu wu-o. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Ukpo a gyi tee la wu kwunvyeru wu ma laa enzu wu, kwunvyeru ungwu ɔnyɛ ungwu e shi laa enzu lɛɛbi. Kwunvyeru kwɔlɛ gba akwu tee Okrasi e yi ma yi, kwuwo kwɔlɛ lu yi ogbo mu inzumbɛku iyi Ukpo.<verse eid="COL 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ki tanu iyi Okrasi laa onzu uwunawuna. Ki tu mbo mo, ki zɔ mba mu ilukwu iyi ki yi yi kaa la ki bo laa onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e lomesu mbala Okrasi kaa la kɔma midu iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mi yi mu ikyikyimo mu ekpasu iyi bɔkɔ Okrasi ee shi mi, iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu ɛduma iwomo ma mi.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Mi gyi te la mi so yi ewo iyi bɔkɔ mi yi mu ebirigo igbomo kwuwo yi mbala enzu umba Olawodisiya mbala umbafo umba bɔkɔ o yi mi mo. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Imi mii wo ɛlɛ kaa mi kamba ɛnwu ma kaa idɛnyi li lo mbo mesu, mi gyi te lo fya esheshi ma duduu tabɔkɔ ɔ zɔngɔma ongbulolo ma awu. Mu ɛlɛ gba o zɔngɔma kwunvyeru ungwu Ukpo ma le, iyi bɔkɔ akwu Okrasi mafyiwu le. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Akwu mawu gba ilukwu mbala iyitu iyi Ukpo lɛɛbi i nvyemo le.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Imi mi so yi ɛlɛ te kaa onzu uwufo le bo laa iso iyi inyima iyi imwilo kaa le kyoro yi mo mo. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Moo mi yi mbala yi mu ɛnwu mo le bi moo mi yi mbala yi mu kwundu, ba mi mwɔnyɛ tabɔkɔ mi ma yi tee lu rima ngiri kyaa mu ikwu idu lu fulo yi mu Okrasi.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inyɔlɔma Iyi Kwunyɔ Akwu Mu Okrasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Tabɔkɔ lu na Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi te lakwu Ɔkwu yi ele, la lu zɛma kyaa mbala wu. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Akpa yi li fyemo mɛzhi mate akpa iyi uwɛyi mɛzhi tayi, la lu mbo ɛnwu yi ma mawu, kaa ikwu idu lu fulo yi li kyo ɛkpasu ma, kyamate bɔkɔ o zɔ yi awu. Akwɛyi la lu koko lu gbɛlɛ ɛnyi.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />La lu ngbɛndu kaa onzu le bo la kwukyoro ungwumbwa mu amasa iyi onzu mo, iyi bɔkɔ enzu ɔ zɔ bɔkɔ i kyo i ngyi mbaa ɛndu iyi wa to keyi umba kwudu kwɔlɛ, moo i ngyi mbaa Okrasi mo. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Moo Okrasi a vindɔ onzu le bi moo, akwu Ukpo yɛriri, <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />akwɛyi lunyi tete lu nyɔlɔma yɛriri mawu. Uwu gba akwu u to keyi uwu asu mbala enzu umba idomo lɛɛbi le.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Kwuwongu lu kyomesu mbala Okrasi awu, i yi kyamate o zɛ yi ɛsɔ ma-a, akwu onzu gba a zɛ yi le mo, Okrasi gba a zɛ yi le, inyi gba akwu iwɔma mu ɛkpasu iyi ɛnwu iyi ingbomo ɛlɛ le. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Moo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o wo yi obatisima awu, o kpa yi ami mbala Okrasi, mu obatisima awu tete lu yimo mbala Okrasi kwuwongu ikwu idu fulo yi mu ɛkpasu iyi Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e yi wu mo mu lukwu awu. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Mekyi lu kpomo mu kwundu kwuwongu ingbomo yi mbala kwuwongu lu kwu Azhu mo umba bɔkɔ o yi Ɛrama iyi Ukpo mo. Kekelele ba Ukpo e shi yi kwunyɔ mu Okrasi-e. Ukpo a gba la ingbomo nzu lɛɛbi a kpanzu-o; <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />ingbomo nzu lɛɛbi Ukpo a ngbɛ yi ma-a, i kyo ɔlu yi lɛɛbi a ka kpayi mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Okrasi a na ekpasu iyi wa to keyi umba ɛndu iyira mbala idomo ma, akwɛyi e lo mbo eseye gedegede tabɔkɔ a bi mba ma awu.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la lu shi kaa onzu uwunawuna le shi yi ɛrama mu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ lu ri, naa embyi umba lu wo, naa Odumudumu uwu Ɔvya Uwepo, naa Kwɔfyi ungwu Ɛnwu Igbomo ungwu Azhu mo. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Apula ɛnyi lɛɛbi akwu kwundu ungwu apula iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu inyɔma; Okrasi gba akwu inyi le shɛ. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la lu nyama kaa onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e to ɛnwu tee a ka uwewe ma, tee a ma ɛbɛ ba a bɔkushi tee lo gbo ɔya laa alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo kaa le kyoro yimo mo. Moo enzu mbamba tayi o bɔma mu amasa iyi onzu <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />ba o rala Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ akwu reshi ingyi ɛnwu le fo. Okrasi gba akwu reshi ingyi ɛnwu wu ɔshɔshi le. Uwu gba e shi ɛnwu lɛɛbi, laa ingyi, laa esa kaa li lomesu kaa li bulɔma mate bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi le.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwunyɔ Ungwepo Mu Okrasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Lu kpomo mbala Okrasi akwɛyi o wayima mbaa ɛkpasu iyi ɛndu iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ-ɛ. I wo te, bɔkɔ lu wo kyamate, lu kwu enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ te? I wo te bɔkɔ lu mbwalu ɛrama ɛnyi tayi iyi i zɔ tee, <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />&lt;&lt;La lu pwu ngyɛlɛ afyi mo,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;La lu pwa ngyɛ ngyi kenzu mo,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;La lu pwafyi mu ɛnyi mo&gt;&gt;? <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Ɛlɛ kpɛkpɛyi akwu apula iyi bɔkɔ i kpɛdɔma; moo akwu ɔkpa mbala ɛzɔ iyi onzu bi. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Ilomo laa ɔkpa ɛlɛ i yi kyamate i shi yi lu wo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi tayi, kyamate ɛnwu inyashi ilomo, mbala ɔya igbomo laa alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo, mbala ɛnwu igyima iyi kwukyoro; tetete akwu tayi gba i yi le mo, moo i yi ɛkpasu iyi bɔkɔ i shi onzu a lafya laa ekweyi iwomo iyi apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ mo.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Kwuwongwu Ukpo e yi yi mo la kwunyɔ mbala Okrasi awu, la lu shi egbo yi mu apula iyoshi, mbaa bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋɔma mu ukpa uwu ɛsu mu kwuwo ungwu ungyi ungwu Ukpo. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />La lu shi egbo yi mu apula iyoshi, moo akwu mu apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ mo. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Moo lu kpomo-o, kwunyɔ yi ba o nvye ngwu mo mbala Okrasi midu iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ akwu kwunyɔ yi shɛ, a ba wɔ awu, lunyi tete luu wɔ mbala wu akwɛyi lu fya ogbo mu inzumbɛku wu!<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luzɛ Undepo Mbala Undekyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la lu lafya la apula iyira iwomo iyi bɔkɔ ɛnwu i gyi, kyamate iyama, apula iyi lovya iwomo, egbo iyɛku ishimo mu iyama, egbo ishimo mu ira iwomo. mbala ekweyi (moo ekweyi i yi mate eshi ibyima tayi). <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Kwuwongwu apula iyi ira ɛlɛ, Ukpo a zɔ amba wu akwɛyi e lo enzu umba bɔkɔ o lowumo mo awu inyashi. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Mekyi lunyi mafyi yi lu wo apula iyira ɛlɛ tete, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ lu yi mu luzɛ ma yi awu.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Kekelele mega lu lafya laa apula ɛlɛ te iwomo ŋa, mate: amba, kwuzhini, anya iyi onzu mbala onzu itutumo. Ari ikpama mbala iso iyi kashi li wɔ mu kenzu yi gbee mo. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />La lu mwulo iyi esu mo, moo lu kwu enzu umbekyi mbala iwomo iyi ari mba fo,<verse eid="COL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />kekelele lu kwu enzu umbepo ŋa. Ukpo e shi lu kwu enzu umbepo akwɛyi e yeyi mu iwomo kaka kaa la lu yi mate uwu tayi, kaa la lu yitu wu marimari. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ikama iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo mbala Azhu, naa umba bɔkɔ o zɛ mba ɛsɔ ma mbala umba bɔkɔ o zɛ mba ɛsɔ ma mo, naa agboga, naa enzu umba bɔkɔ eyi mba i wuma mo, enye, enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu enye mo, i yi fo, kpɛkpɛmba akwu wakpɛnyi ŋa moo Okrasi gba akwu iyinayina le, uwu gba ba e yi mu uwewe le.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Ukpo a ŋa yi tee kaa la lu kwu enzu wu wakɛrikɛri umba bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi mba gyɔɔ. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la lu ma eyembembyi iyi esu, la lu zɔ esu ari iyeshi, la lu kwu enzu umba egbo, la lu fulo ɛyi mu kadu mo, la lu yidu mbala esu. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />La lu yidu mbala esu, la lu gba laa ingbomo iyi esu lu kpa. Mate bɔkɔ Ɔkwu a gba laa ingbomo yi a kpa yi awu, tatayi gba luu gba yi lu kpa enzu le. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Iyi i ka ɛlɛ ma lɛɛbi bɔkɔ luu kyo gba akwu tee la lu pwu idɛnyi iyi esu, moo idɛnyi gba i lo enzu mesu akwɛyi akwu wakpɛnyi yɛriri le. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />La lu nyama kaa oloto uwu Okrasi e shi yi awu lu to keyi mu egbo yi; moo akwu kwuwongu oloto ɔlɛ gba Ukpo a ya yi ma kya mu ɛnwu ikpɛnyi le. La lu gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi kwuyengwunanguna. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />La lu shi iso iyi Okrasi li ŋɔma mu egbo yi gyɔɔ. La lu zɔ esu iso iyi Okrasi ɛlɛ, la lu yi esu malu mu ilukwu iyinayina. La lu so amu laa Ukpo, mbala amu iyi Odevidi mbala amu iyi Ukpo iduma, la lu gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi mu egbo yi. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Kiya ingyinangyina bɔkɔ luu wo naa lu so, la lu wo yi lɛɛbi mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi, la lu gbɛlɛ Ukpo Ada ɛnyi i zɛ mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iŋɔma iyi I Kpo Laa Kwogba Ungwu U mbwalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Eko umba anu, la lu ra laa ɛyi la lu shi umba anu yi, moo inyi gba i fa tee wa mbwalu Ɔkwu lo wo le.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Anu umba eko, la lu gyi eko yi, la lu wo mbala mba lambalamba mo.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Ɛmɛ, la lu lomo laa umba ete yi mbala umba anyi yi kwuyengwunanguna, moo ɛlɛ gba Ukpo a gyi le.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Umba ada, la lu shi ɛmɛ yi lo wo amba mbala yi kwuwongu ɛyi ikpama kwuyengwunanguna mo, moo ɛlɛ te ii mu mba ɛnwu ma.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Lunyi enye, la lu lomo laa ada umba kwogba yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mu iyinayina bɔkɔ luu wo, la lu lomo mbomo kwuyengwu o ye yi mu imama kɛɛkyi kaa lɔ du yi ma mo; lunyi ba la lu wo yi mu egbo ikpɛnyi kwuwongu luu wiyi iyi Ɔkwu. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Iyinayina bɔkɔ luu wo, la lu wo yi mu egbo ikpɛnyi, mate luu wo laa Ɔkwu tayi moo akwu laa enzu mo.<verse eid="COL 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />La lu lolo tee Ɔkwu ee shi yi rigbɛ ingyi bɔkɔ e shi mɛzhi la enzu wu awu, moo Okrasi gba akwu Adakwogba yi shɛ le. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Ukpo ee shi enzu umba bɔkɔ oo wo apula iyira rigbɛ ingyi apula iyira iyi bɔkɔ o wo, moo Ukpo aa zɔ kusɛ mo.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Ada umba kwogba, la lu wo enye yi ɔnyɔnyɛ. Lunyi la lu lolo tee lunyi tete lu yi Adakwogba moshi.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iye Mu Alu Mekeka Iyi Ukpo Ilɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />La lu kyakpɔ mu Ukpo ilɛma, la lu rima mu igbomo tabɔkɔ lu lɛ Ukpo awu, la lu gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Lunyi ba la lu lɛ Ukpo kwuwo nzu tete, kaa Ukpo le shi nzu kapa kaa la ki tanu iyi kwunvyeru iyi Okrasi. Moo akwu kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba mi yi mu ugu ugyi le. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la lu lɛ Ukpo kaa la mi tanu ɛlɛ marimari.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />La lu yi ilukwu mu iŋɔma yi mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu wa mbwalu mo, kapa unganangana unga bɔkɔ lu fya, la lu wo ɛduma ma nga. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Iso iyi kenzu yi la kwu iyi angba lu ŋɔ mbala esheshi, la lu yitu iyi lu gba opwu uwesheshi laa onzu uwunawuna.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛnyi Igbɛlɛma Imbwambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Umɛza nzu uwu kasɛkɛ Otakiku, uwu bɔkɔ akwu u mbwalu shɛ mbala u mbwalu mu ɛduma iyi Ɔkwu iwomo awu, a ba yi ɛza mi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Akwu kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba mi ye wu mu ilɔma munyi yi le, kaa le so yi ewo iyi bɔkɔ ki yi mu iwomo kaa la ka yi ɛnwu ma. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Mi lɔ Onisimo ma kaa la zɛ mbala wu tete, umanyi nzu mbala onzu ongbulolo, uwu bɔkɔ e kyo muzhi yi awu. O so yi apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu iwomo munɛ.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Arisitaku, uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu ugu ugyi mbala mi ele, e ye yi mu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma, i kyo Omaki, uwu bɔkɔ akwu ɛmɛ umbi imɛnɛ mbala Obanaba awu. (O so yi-e ewo iyi bɔkɔ luu na Omaki ma mu ewo epo akwiyi gba e bo munyi yi.) <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Ozhoshuwa uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu te Ɔzhɔsitu awu, a lɔ ma tee lɔ gbɛlɛ yi ɛnyi tete. Enzu wala mbɔlɛ kɛɛkyi gba akwu Azhu umba bɔkɔ akwu wa mbwalu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ɛduma iwomo iyi Irɛsu iyi Ukpo mbala mi le, umba ba o ye mi mu imbwama gyɔɔ.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafarasi, uwu e kyo mu uzhi yi, ba akwu umɛgba uwu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi awu, e ye yi mu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma. Aa lɛ Ukpo shɛ kwuwo yi kwuyengwunanguna, a nda Ukpo te le shi yi kaa la lu rima ngiri, kaa la lu kɔma kaa la lu kwu wa mbwalu umba bɔkɔ o wo iyi Ukpo a gyi. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Imi mafyi mi mi na izɔgɔ iyi ɛduma iyɛkɔ iyi bɔkɔ e wo kwuwo yi mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Olawodisiya mbala Ɛrapɔli.<verse eid="COL 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Oluku, u lo epu uwu idɛnyi nzu, mbala Odimasi o lɔ ma tee lɔ gbɛlɛ yi ɛnyi.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />La lu gbɛlɛ wa mbwalu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Olawodisiya mbala Onifa mbala Ɔshɔshi uwu bɔkɔ o kpalɛlu mogba wu awu ɛnyi. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ lu wa kwupwu kwɔlɛ ma, la lu shi kaa lo wanguma mu ɔshɔshi uwu e yi mu Olawodisiya awu tete. Tatayi la lu wa kwupwu ungwu bɔkɔ wa mbwalu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Olawodisiya awu o bo lɔ o ka yi.<verse eid="COL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />La lu za laa Akipu tee, &lt;&lt;Bɔ kwuyi kaa mbwa ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ Ɔkwu e shi ŋɔ awu iwomo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Mu kwuwo mi gba mi ka ɛnyi igbɛlɛma ɛlɛ le: Ɛnyi igbɛlɛma mbaa Ɔpɔlu. La lu kala kuleyi te mi yi mu ɛyɛ mo mɛɛ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Esheshi iyi Ukpo mi li yi mbala yi.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>